---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import QuoteForm from '../../../../components/QuoteForm.astro';
import '../../../../styles/detail.css';

const title = '海外项目钢结构按图加工与定制制造 | 中赛钢构';
const description = '中赛钢构为海外项目提供钢结构按图加工与定制制造服务，根据项目图纸、深化图和BOQ进行钢梁、钢柱、桁架及定制构件加工，支持包装装柜与出口交付。';
const lang = 'zh';
const canonical = 'https://zhongsai-steelstructure.com/zh/products/custom-engineering/';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="detail-hero">
    <div class="detail-hero-bg" style="background-image: url('/images/company/factory-steel-beam-fabrication.jpg');"></div>
    <div class="detail-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="detail-hero-content">
      <span class="eyebrow">按图加工 · 定制制造</span>
      <h1>海外项目钢结构按图加工与定制制造</h1>
      <p class="lead">中赛钢构是中国钢结构制造与出口供应商，根据项目图纸、深化图和技术要求进行钢构件加工与供应，从图纸审核到包装装柜出口，为海外工程公司和采购方提供按图定制的钢结构制造服务。</p>
      <div class="detail-hero-actions">
        <a href="#quote" class="btn btn-primary">提交图纸获取评估</a>
        <a href="/zh/manufacturing-quality/" class="btn btn-outline">查看制造能力</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="detail-breadcrumb">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/zh/">首页</a>
      <span class="sep">/</span>
      <a href="/zh/products/">产品</a>
      <span class="sep">/</span>
      <span class="current">定制工程与按图加工</span>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- 01 Custom Fabrication to Project Drawings -->
  <section class="detail-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">01 / 按图加工</p>
        <h2>根据项目图纸进行钢结构定制加工</h2>
        <p>中赛钢构根据客户提供的结构图纸、深化图、技术规格书和工程量清单（BOQ），组织钢构件的定制加工与供应。具体材料、尺寸、焊接要求和表面处理按项目图纸与技术要求确定。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="image-text-block">
        <div class="itb-image">
          <img src="/images/manufacturing/real/steel-welding-assembly-9822.jpg" alt="中赛钢构钢结构按图加工制造现场" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="itb-content">
          <h3>从图纸到构件的定制制造</h3>
          <p>中赛钢构拥有自有生产基地，可根据项目图纸进行钢梁、钢柱、桁架、支撑及定制钢构件的加工制造。</p>
          <ul>
            <li>根据结构图纸和深化图组织加工</li>
            <li>按项目技术规格书控制制造要求</li>
            <li>可配合BOQ进行构件清单核对与报价</li>
            <li>具体材料牌号、焊接工艺和检验要求按项目约定执行</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 02 What We Can Fabricate -->
  <section class="detail-section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">02 / 可加工构件</p>
        <h2>中赛钢构可以加工哪些钢结构构件</h2>
        <p>根据项目图纸和技术要求，中赛钢构可加工以下类型钢结构构件。具体加工范围和技术要求按项目图纸确认。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="requirement-grid">
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="req-icon">01</div>
          <h3>钢梁</h3>
          <p>H型钢、箱型梁、组合梁等，按图纸尺寸和焊接要求加工。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="req-icon">02</div>
          <h3>钢柱</h3>
          <p>H型钢柱、箱型柱、格构柱等，按项目结构图纸加工。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="req-icon">03</div>
          <h3>钢桁架</h3>
          <p>管桁架、H型钢桁架等，按节点图和焊接要求加工。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="req-icon">04</div>
          <h3>支撑与连接</h3>
          <p>柱间支撑、屋面支撑、节点板、连接板等配套构件。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="req-icon">05</div>
          <h3>平台与定制构件</h3>
          <p>设备平台、操作平台、楼梯及定制异形钢构件。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="req-icon">06</div>
          <h3>次结构构件</h3>
          <p>檩条、拉条、隅撑等次结构构件，可随主体结构一并供应。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 24px;">
        <a href="/zh/components/" class="btn btn-outline">查看构件与材料</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 03 From Drawings to Fabrication -->
  <section class="detail-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">03 / 加工流程</p>
        <h2>从图纸到出口交付的加工流程</h2>
        <p>以下为按图加工的简要流程。详细制造过程、质量控制和8步制造流程请查看制造能力页面。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-flow">
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="step-num">01</div>
          <h4>项目资料提交</h4>
          <p>图纸、BOQ、技术规格书与项目国家</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="step-num">02</div>
          <h4>图纸审核</h4>
          <p>结构图纸与加工可行性审核</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="step-num">03</div>
          <h4>深化协调</h4>
          <p>深化图与加工图协调确认</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-4">
          <div class="step-num">04</div>
          <h4>材料准备</h4>
          <p>按项目要求组织钢材与配套材料</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="step-num">05</div>
          <h4>制造加工</h4>
          <p>切割、组立、焊接、矫正、钻孔</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="step-num">06</div>
          <h4>表面处理</h4>
          <p>按项目要求安排抛丸与涂层</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="step-num">07</div>
          <h4>标识包装</h4>
          <p>构件标识、编号与包装装柜</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-4">
          <div class="step-num">08</div>
          <h4>出口交付</h4>
          <p>出口单证支持与物流协调</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 24px;">
        <a href="/zh/manufacturing-quality/" class="btn btn-outline">查看详细8步制造流程</a>
